WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.667
(festive music)

00:00:07.800 --> 00:00:09.927
- Hi, my name's Dusty Rose

00:00:10.920 --> 00:00:13.533
and I writing a letter to Santa.

00:00:14.520 --> 00:00:18.570
It's a dream house RV with a kitchen.

00:00:18.570 --> 00:00:20.457
And I hope, I hope I get it.

00:00:20.457 --> 00:00:24.060
And my favorite thing
to do about Christmas

00:00:24.060 --> 00:00:25.740
is decorate the tree.

00:00:25.740 --> 00:00:27.063
And I love going to the snow

00:00:27.063 --> 00:00:28.950
with my family in Colorado.

00:00:28.950 --> 00:00:30.381
Bye!

00:00:30.381 --> 00:00:32.301
(audience clapping and cheering)

00:00:32.301 --> 00:00:35.430
- Dusty Rose, you are so adorable!

00:00:35.430 --> 00:00:36.840
I love you so much.

00:00:36.840 --> 00:00:37.920
And what a great middle name,

00:00:37.920 --> 00:00:38.760
might I add.

00:00:38.760 --> 00:00:40.620
You remind me of my little river Rose.

00:00:40.620 --> 00:00:41.490
All week everybody,

00:00:41.490 --> 00:00:43.380
we've teamed up with
our season long partner,

00:00:43.380 --> 00:00:44.640
Pilot Frixion Pen,

00:00:44.640 --> 00:00:46.260
the go-to a erasable pen

00:00:46.260 --> 00:00:47.640
of the Kelly Clarkson Show.

00:00:47.640 --> 00:00:49.410
We're giving Santa an assist

00:00:49.410 --> 00:00:50.910
with some Christmas wishlists.

00:00:50.910 --> 00:00:52.080
And Dusty Rose,

00:00:52.080 --> 00:00:54.420
we wanna celebrate creative
kids just like you,

00:00:54.420 --> 00:00:56.970
so we are giving you a thousand dollars

00:00:56.970 --> 00:01:00.153
to get your very own dream
house RV with a kitchen!

00:01:00.153 --> 00:01:01.920
Merry Christmas!

00:01:01.920 --> 00:01:03.210
And to everyone watching,

00:01:03.210 --> 00:01:04.260
remember you can pick up

00:01:04.260 --> 00:01:05.790
Pilot Frixion erasable pens

00:01:05.790 --> 00:01:08.253
wherever office supplies are sold.

